# The repository root ignores every data/ directory to keep large
# behaviour-cloning datasets (images + labels) out of git.
#
# This module instead ships two *small* labelled input datasets (~0.7 MB in
# total) that are required inputs: `python main.py` reads imu_drive.json by
# default, and carla_drive.json is the CARLA recording used for the second
# verification link.
#
# The two *_results.json files are program output, not inputs: they are
# regenerated by every run, so they stay ignored (review suggestion: commit
# inputs only). Re-include exactly the two input datasets here instead of
# editing the shared root .gitignore or weakening its rule repository-wide.
!data/
data/*
!data/imu_drive.json
!data/carla_drive.json
